CIMA/AEMPS information
----------------------
Fuente de la información: Agencia Española de Medicamentos y Productos Sanitarios
www.aemps.gob.es

The application displays the requested presentation's source and retrieval time, and
retains provenance with a verified name. A manually renamed medication loses the saved
catalogue attribution. No catalogue dataset, images or real medicine fixtures are bundled.
No AEMPS participation, sponsorship, endorsement or medical certification is implied.

